pe":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"｢おもてなし会｣で\nめいめいさんにカラーガードを\n教えてもらえたこと、ずっと忘れません。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"初めの頃はめいめいさんがやった大技に挑戦すると聞いて｢私になんて...｣と不安でいっぱいでしたが、めいめいさんと関わる第一歩になったと思うと今は挑戦してよかったと胸を張って言えます︎☺︎"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://cdn.hinatazaka46.com/files/14/diary/official/member/moblog/202501/mobjgpdBn.jpg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://cdn.hinatazaka46.com/files/14/diary/official/member/moblog/202501/mob3Fr4Na.jpg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"また一緒に戯れましょう🐈"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"今まで本当にありがとうございました...!"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ドレス姿のめいめいさん\n本当に可愛かったです..."},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"🎀♡"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://cdn.hinatazaka46.com/files/14/diary/official/member/moblog/202501/mobDHfGJb.jpg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://cdn.hinatazaka46.com/files/14/diary/official/member/moblog/202501/mobtp1fLo.jpg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"｢どうする?どうする?どうする?｣"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"最初で最後\n一緒に披露できて嬉しかったです🎤"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"それでは今日はこの辺で。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://cdn.hinatazaka46.com/files/14/diary/official/member/moblog/202501/mobLkpbL7.jpg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://cdn.hinatazaka46.com/files/14/diary/official/member/moblog/202501/mobZvxiU7.jpg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"一緒に制服デートに行ったの\n懐かしいです..."},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ずっと大好きです。"},{"type":"break"},