恐いのでも、、、。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"自分がドラマをやらせていただけた時は"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"自分の演技の出来なさに萎えて"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"苦手だなぁとかマイナスなことを思っていたけど、"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"こうやって時間が経って"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"色々な作品に触れてみると"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"発見があったり、勉強になったり、"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"また挑戦してみたいな…"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"なんて思ったり…。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"改めて、"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"色々なことを経験させていただけてたなぁって。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"なんかしんみりしちゃったけど、"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"皆さん、"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"オススメ教えてください!(笑)"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://cdn.keyakizaka46.com/images/14/3a8/9482d0b7fb832027033ef2d724d21.png","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://cdn.keyakizaka46.com/images/14/3a8/9482d0b7fb832027033ef2d724d21-01.png","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"だにちゃん。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"b